   mode (feature or improve).

   `EXPECTED_STAGES` **is** `STAGES` — the ordered list validated at loop start.
   There is no fused-command file to derive it from any more (ADR-014), so there is
   also no way for the expected set and the invoked set to drift apart.

   Run the verify CLI inside {{ WTP }}:
{% if is_codex %}
   ```
   Bash("{{ cdwt }}uv run --with {{ harness_maker_src_path }} hm iter_receipts verify --iter <N> --expected <EXPECTED_STAGES> --root \"{{ WTR }}\"")
